From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 14:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Sable apps step, Full, Essentials or Stock

Plan phase C, optional Sable apps: a step after Theme (shown as part of
step 5, so the count stays at 8) offers Full Sable, Essentials or Stock
Android. Next disables the apps left out for this user with
COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE_DISABLED_USER, never uninstalls anything, and
remembers the choice in Settings.Secure sable_app_set; Settings, Apps,
Enable brings any app back, and Full Sable turns every Sable app on.

* Essentials is the owner's set: Keyboard, Start, Setup, Tools, Hub,
  Messages, Camera and Vault.
* Stock Android turns a Sable app off when it has no LineageOS
  counterpart or its counterpart is installed, so Sable Messages stays
  on while the image has no other SMS app.
* A LineageOS app is never disabled: where a Sable app goes off, its
  installed counterpart (Messaging, Etar, Twelve, ExactCalculator,
  Aperture, Jelly) is turned on.
* Start, Keyboard, Setup, Display Compat, the speech engine and the
  screen reader are never turned off.
* The Ready screen's bar line now matches Start's dots-only bottom row
  and names Alt+Space.

Pure policy: sable/SableAppSet.java.
